---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, PLACE, POLICY_UPDATED } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base
  title="Terms & conditions — OLMIKAYA"
  description="The terms on which OLMIKAYA publishes, and what you may do with what you read here."
  current="terms"
  showSections={false}
>
  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="col-8 start-3 stack reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
          <h1 class="display-l">Terms &amp; conditions</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            What you can expect from us, and what we ask in return.
          </p>
          <p class="small muted">Last updated {POLICY_UPDATED}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="col-8 start-3">
          <div class="prose reveal">
            <h2>Who we are</h2>
            <p>
              OLMIKAYA is an independent editorial and lifestyle company based
              in {PLACE}. Using this site means accepting these terms.
            </p>

            <h2>What you may do with the writing</h2>
            <p>
              Read it, quote it, and link to it. Quote a reasonable extract with
              our name on it and a link back, and you need no permission.
            </p>
            <p>
              Republishing a piece in full, or using our photography, wordmark
              or design elsewhere, does need permission. Ask — we are not
              precious, but we do want to know.
            </p>
            <p>
              Everything published here remains the property of OLMIKAYA or of
              the writer or photographer credited on it.
            </p>

            <h2>The directory</h2>
            <p>
              Directory entries describe places we have visited more than once.
              Nothing is listed because it paid to be, and we do not take
              payment for coverage of any kind. Entries are our opinion at the
              time of writing, and places change — check before you travel.
            </p>
            <p>
              If you run somewhere we have listed and want it removed, write to
              us and we will remove it.
            </p>

            <h2>The letter</h2>
            <p>
              Signing up is free and leaving is one click. We may change what
              the letter contains or how often it goes out; if it changes in
              any material way, the letter itself will say so first.
            </p>

            <h2>Objects</h2>
            <p>
              Nothing on this site is currently for sale. There is no cart, no
              checkout and no payment processing anywhere on it. When that
              changes, terms of sale will be published here before anything can
              be bought, not after.
            </p>

            <h2>Accuracy, and getting it wrong</h2>
            <p>
              We report carefully and we still get things wrong. When we do, we
              correct the piece and say that we corrected it. Nothing is quietly
              edited after publication.
            </p>
            <p>
              The site is published as it is. We do not warrant that it will
              always be available or error-free, and nothing here is
              professional advice — not legal, financial, medical or otherwise.
              Decisions you take on the strength of what you read here are
              yours.
            </p>

            <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
            <p>
              We link to places we find worth reading. We do not control them
              and are not responsible for what they publish or collect.
            </p>

            <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
            <p>
              If these terms change in substance, the date at the top changes
              with them.
            </p>

            <h2>Governing law</h2>
            <p>
              These terms are governed by the laws of Kenya.
            </p>

            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>
              <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
